{"page":177,"width":1712,"height":2392,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"메인 메모리","words":[{"text":"메인","x":436,"y":516,"width":39,"height":23},{"text":"메모리","x":485,"y":517,"width":59,"height":24}]},{"text":"[그림 6-5] 연결리스트에서의 스t제연산","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":166,"y":627,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"6-5]","x":231,"y":626,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"연결리스트에서의","x":302,"y":629,"width":171,"height":27},{"text":"스t제연산","x":482,"y":632,"width":84,"height":25}]},{"text":"하나의 프로그램 안에는 동시에 여러 개의 연결 리스트가 존재할 수 있다. 이런 경우. 연결 리","words":[{"text":"하나의","x":198,"y":738,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"프로그램","x":292,"y":738,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"안에는","x":414,"y":738,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"동시에","x":503,"y":739,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"여러","x":594,"y":739,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"개의","x":657,"y":738,"width":49,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":720,"y":739,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"리스트가","x":784,"y":739,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"존재할","x":901,"y":738,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":993,"y":739,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":1032,"y":737,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"이런","x":1107,"y":738,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"경우.","x":1172,"y":737,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":1247,"y":737,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"리","x":1312,"y":737,"width":22,"height":31}]},{"text":"스트들을 구별하는 것은 첫 번째 데이터이다. 첫 번째 데이터만 알 수 있으면 연결 리스트의 나","words":[{"text":"스트들을","x":164,"y":792,"width":113,"height":31},{"text":"구별하는","x":288,"y":791,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"것은","x":413,"y":792,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"첫","x":477,"y":792,"width":24,"height":31},{"text":"번째","x":515,"y":792,"width":49,"height":32},{"text":"데이터이다.","x":578,"y":792,"width":136,"height":32},{"text":"첫","x":731,"y":792,"width":24,"height":31},{"text":"번째","x":769,"y":792,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"데이터만","x":834,"y":792,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"알","x":954,"y":792,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":992,"y":792,"width":28,"height":32},{"text":"있으면","x":1032,"y":792,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"연결","x":1125,"y":791,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"리스트의","x":1192,"y":790,"width":104,"height":32},{"text":"나","x":1311,"y":791,"width":27,"height":32}]},{"text":"머지 데이터들은 줄만 따라가면 얻을 수 있다. 연결 리스트의 또 하나의 장점은 데이터를 저장할","words":[{"text":"머지","x":165,"y":846,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"데이터들은","x":231,"y":845,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"줄만","x":379,"y":846,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"따라가면","x":445,"y":845,"width":105,"height":32},{"text":"얻을","x":563,"y":846,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":623,"y":846,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":661,"y":845,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"연결","x":733,"y":845,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"리스트의","x":797,"y":846,"width":104,"height":32},{"text":"또","x":914,"y":849,"width":28,"height":24},{"text":"하나의","x":952,"y":846,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"장점은","x":1044,"y":845,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"데이터를","x":1137,"y":845,"width":109,"height":31},{"text":"저장할","x":1256,"y":844,"width":82,"height":32}]},{"text":"공간이 필요할 때마다 동적으로 공간을 만들어서 쉽게 추가할 수 있다는 것이다. 이것은 순자적","words":[{"text":"공간이","x":163,"y":899,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"필요할","x":260,"y":898,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"때마다","x":354,"y":899,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"동적으로","x":445,"y":899,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"공간을","x":563,"y":899,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"만들어서","x":653,"y":899,"width":102,"height":32},{"text":"쉽게","x":770,"y":899,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"추가할","x":834,"y":900,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":928,"y":900,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"있다는","x":968,"y":900,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"것이다.","x":1061,"y":899,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"이것은","x":1164,"y":899,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"순자적","x":1255,"y":898,"width":79,"height":32}]},{"text":"인 표현 방법인 배열에 비하여 상당한 장점이 된다.","words":[{"text":"인","x":165,"y":953,"width":24,"height":30},{"text":"표현","x":200,"y":952,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"방법인","x":266,"y":952,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"배열에","x":360,"y":952,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"비하여","x":452,"y":952,"width":76,"height":32},{"text":"상당한","x":540,"y":952,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"장점이","x":629,"y":953,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"된다.","x":716,"y":953,"width":59,"height":31}]},{"text":"그러나 장점만 있는 것은 아니고 배열에 비하여 상대적으로 구현이 어렵고 오류가 나기 쉬운","words":[{"text":"그러나","x":194,"y":1006,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"장점만","x":290,"y":1005,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"있는","x":387,"y":1006,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"것은","x":452,"y":1006,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"아니고","x":515,"y":1005,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"배열에","x":606,"y":1006,"width":75,"height":32},{"text":"비하여","x":696,"y":1006,"width":75,"height":32},{"text":"상대적으로","x":786,"y":1006,"width":137,"height":32},{"text":"구현이","x":934,"y":1007,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"어렵고","x":1030,"y":1007,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"오류가","x":1123,"y":1007,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"나기","x":1217,"y":1006,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"쉬운","x":1283,"y":1006,"width":55,"height":31}]},{"text":"점은 단점이라 할 수 있다. 또 데이터뿐만 아니라 포인터도 저장하여야 하므로 메모리 공간을 많","words":[{"text":"점은","x":164,"y":1059,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"단점이라","x":229,"y":1059,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"할","x":350,"y":1059,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":387,"y":1060,"width":28,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":427,"y":1059,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"또","x":498,"y":1063,"width":27,"height":23},{"text":"데이터뿐만","x":536,"y":1059,"width":131,"height":32},{"text":"아니라","x":675,"y":1059,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"포인터도","x":765,"y":1060,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"저장하여야","x":885,"y":1060,"width":139,"height":32},{"text":"하므로","x":1032,"y":1061,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"메모리","x":1126,"y":1060,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"공간을","x":1217,"y":1061,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"많","x":1310,"y":1060,"width":28,"height":32}]},{"text":"이 시용한다. 또 i번째 데이터를 찾으려